{"synopsis":"Lima tahun lalu, sebuah bencana besar menghancurkan kehidupan damai umat manusia hanya dalam satu hari. Sejak saat itu, muncullah “Zona Khusus” misterius di berbagai penjuru dunia, masing-masing dengan tingkat kesulitannya sendiri.\n\nMaya Ichijo, yang hampir berhasil menaklukkan semua 100 zona untuk meraih gelar “Grand Slam,” dikhianati oleh rekan-rekannya sendiri dan terbunuh di ujian terakhir.\n\nNamun, di napas terakhirnya… ia justru terbangun kembali di dunia sebelum bencana itu terjadi.\n\nKini, berbekal semua ingatan dari kehidupannya yang lalu, ia bersumpah akan menuntut balas—\nkarena di dunia ini, monster sebenarnya bukanlah para zombie… melainkan manusia.","alternative_title":"リベンジャー：終末の復讐","author":"COBI","artist":"HNS Studio, COBI","chapters":[{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"b2a282fe-4194-41a9-817e-b2f257e7b7ac","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2026-04-18"},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"bfff8595-134e-43bc-b876-c161922e7d94","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2026-03-25"},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"26859754-b90d-4aba-8d73-4105a9879188","title":"Chapter 32","date":"2026-03-22"},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"46075ab5-9f37-4c15-8b97-cc631329eac2","title":"Chapter 31","date":"2026-03-12"},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"a07aff95-51ad-4c51-9fdf-3c43ab3bd19a","title":"Chapter 30","date":"2026-03-11"},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"b55ef8a6-8cd4-44ec-9438-ec27e55e6928","title":"Chapter 29","date":"2026-03-08"},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"5fd901aa-a048-4f86-837b-508a6636d85e","title":"Chapter 28","date":"2026-03-05"},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"96130bf2-f4e8-428d-b650-1c7533428677","title":"Chapter 27","date":"2026-03-03"},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"b77ffa6f-5666-41c9-b89f-8c7f59ec7c52","title":"Chapter 26","date":"2026-03-02"},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"6fe750c7-cd32-43b1-9089-8e8d590b8d33","title":"Chapter 25","date":"2026-03-01"},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"21